      "direction": "directed",
      "polarity": "asserted"
    },
    {
      "id": "4f5ebc7a-e7a3-59e4-b5a9-4aeaf8503419",
      "sourceCardId": "d7cdee75-8268-5bfa-9beb-ff73d2c75750",
      "targetCardId": "18c55529-c2b9-5ae6-aac7-74e42cf6f859",
      "category": "structural",
      "body": "우칠로비는 쿠아틀리쿠에에게서 무장한 채 태어난다. 근거 카드 ID: 18c55529-c2b9-5ae6-aac7-74e42cf6f859. 출처:  https://revistas.inah.gob.mx/index.php/anales/article/download/6489/7330.",
      "label": "무장한 탄생",
      "direction": "directed",
      "polarity": "asserted"
    },
    {
